  "description": "NOTE: FREE BONUS ITEMS (limited time): Rear Cargo Rack, Bottle Cage, Kickstand\n\nWell Designed and Proven - There are only a few good choices when buying a high grade touring bike Trek 520, Windsor Tourist XTL, Co-Motion Nor'Wester, Rivendell Atlantis, and so on. These bikes are all high grade touring specific bikes that have many features in common - including price tags well over $1200. Windsor's product engineers designed this bike for comfortable loaded commuting or touring. The angles of the light/strong Aluminum frame are relaxed for stability, the wheelbase is long, the clearances around the wheels sufficient for fat, sturdy tires up to 44c.\n\nYou will go further and faster in comfort because this bike is so comfy and capable for touring, commuting and more adventures.",
